This is a "plugin" for the Video Disk Recorder (VDR).

Written by:                  Frank Neumann <fnu@vdr-portal.de>
                             The code was written with Claude (Anthropic).

Project's homepage:          https://github.com/unf/vdr-plugin-mcp

Latest version available at: https://github.com/unf/vdr-plugin-mcp

